[20.609248, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;255mpolicy violations without the platform\u001b[0m  \u001b[38;5;255m42             \u001b[0m  \u001b[38;5;255m0               \u001b[0m  \u001b[38;5;255m\u2212100%          \u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;255mremediation iterations                \u001b[0m  \u001b[38;5;255m\u2014              \u001b[0m  \u001b[38;5;255m3               \u001b[0m  \u001b[38;5;255mconverged      \u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;255mmonthly cost, first proposal          \u001b[0m  \u001b[38;5;255m$960.82        \u001b[0m  \u001b[38;5;255m$359.15         \u001b[0m  \u001b[38;5;255m\u2212$601.67       \u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;255mday-2 drift found                     \u001b[0m  \u001b[38;5;255m\u2014              \u001b[0m  \u001b[38;5;255m4 fields        \u001b[0m  \u001b[38;5;255m2 critical     \u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;255mcluster mutations by an agent         \u001b[0m  \u001b[38;5;255m\u2014              \u001b[0m  \u001b[38;5;255m0               \u001b[0m  \u001b[38;5;255mby construction\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;5;154m\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;154mThe agent is not the platform.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;5;245mAct II is what an agent does with a model and no platform: 42 ways\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;245mto be plausibly, confidently wrong. The only thing that changed by\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;245mAct V was the platform around it \u2014 a golden path, a provisioner set,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;245ma policy bundle, and an authorization model that treats an agent as\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;245ma principal with a blast radius.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;5;245mDORA\u2019s 2025 finding, in one line: where platform quality is low, the\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;245meffect of AI adoption on organisational performance is negligible.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[20.609275, "o", "  \u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;255mAgentic platform engineering is not AI replacing platform engineers.\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;255mIt is platform engineers becoming the thing that decides whether\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;255many of this is safe to turn on.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
